OL,3,GNEWSAUnwanted garages to be turned into
OL,4,Ahomes and parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnwanted garages will be turned into
OL,7,Fhousing, extra parking and EV charging
OL,8,Ffacilities after a council approved new
OL,9,Fplans.
OL,11,FMilton Keynes City Council said it
OL,12,Fwould continue investing in garages
OL,13,F"valued by residents", while
OL,14,Fredeveloping "derelict and vandalised"
OL,15,Fsites.
OL,17,FThe authority said work would begin
OL,18,Fimmediately to identify relevant
OL,19,Flocations and develop proposals for
OL,20,Falternative uses.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
